        {
          "id": 1511156373,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "@geraldcombs Now, it seems I have misled you on this. I tried this just now:\n\n- took the latest `master`\n- commented out the lines this change added\n- compiled on my VM\n- copied the resulting RelWithDebInfo folder to a workstation that has multiple monitors (#18146 lists all my tests)\n- ran Wireshark.exe from that folder\n- tested with 125% and 175% scaling\n- I had absolutely no issues at all\n\n--> This fix didn't do anything to it, it is something else in the `master` branch, Qt6 or something. I just wasn't really testing the multiple monitor setup with any other 4.1.0rc0 snapshot before trying this change (I kind of assumed this was still a problem in 4.1.0 and just tested this other case). Sorry about the incorrect conclusion.",
