    {
      "id": "692fb19c7b22ed5111f7a2dd820506312f8d7b77",
      "individual_note": false,
      "resolvable": true,
      "resolved": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1510596713,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "On Linux (Qt6), this seems to make scrolling the packet list essentially unusable.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-08-12T05:52:33.649Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-08-12T07:01:44.169Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 192106872,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 8971,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 1510682926,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I don't have a Linux host here to test with now, but on Windows 11 I don't see any difference in scroll speed (tested with the Ultimate PCAP).\n\nNow that I compare latest dev installer and 4.0.7 side by side (two identical monitors), I do see difference in the text size in all non-packet related texts (menus, buttons, footer texts): in the dev texts are bigger.\n\n(Ah, I see at least the Qt version is different, I'll leave these here now anyway)\n\n![image](/uploads/7c3936b32849b07730472a8459f96706/image.png)\n\nThis is the external monitor, 2560x1440 with 100% scaling (while the main screen (laptop) is 125%).\n\n------\n\nVersion 4.0.7 (v4.0.7-0-g0ad1823cc090).\n\nCompiled (64-bit) using Microsoft Visual Studio 2022 (VC++ 14.32, build 31332),\nwith GLib 2.72.3, with PCRE2, with zlib 1.2.12, with Qt 5.15.2, with libpcap,\nwith Lua 5.2.4, with GnuTLS 3.6.3 and PKCS #11 support, with Gcrypt 1.10.1, with\nKerberos (MIT), with MaxMind, with nghttp2 1.46.0, with brotli, with LZ4, with\nZstandard, with Snappy, with libxml2 2.9.14, with libsmi 0.4.8, with\nQtMultimedia, with automatic updates using WinSparkle 0.8.0, with AirPcap, with\nSpeexDSP (using bundled resampler), with Minizip, with binary plugins.\n\nRunning on 64-bit Windows (22H2), build 22621, with 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM)\ni7-1270P (with SSE4.2), with 32435 MB of physical memory, with GLib 2.72.3, with\nPCRE2 10.40 2022-04-14, with **Qt 5.15.2**, with Npcap version 1.75, based on\nlibpcap version 1.10.4, with c-ares 1.18.1, with GnuTLS 3.6.3, with Gcrypt\n1.10.1, with nghttp2 1.46.0, with brotli 1.0.9, with LZ4 1.9.3, with Zstandard\n1.5.2, without AirPcap, with light display mode, **without HiDPI**, with\nLC_TYPE=Finnish_Finland.utf8, binary plugins supported.\n\n------\n\nVersion 4.1.0rc0-3368-ga03041e601c7 (v4.1.0rc0-3368-ga03041e601c7).\n\nCompiled (64-bit) using Microsoft Visual Studio 2022 (VC++ 14.36, build 32537),\nwith GLib 2.72.3, with Qt 6.5.2, with libpcap, with zlib 1.2.12, with PCRE2,\nwith Lua 5.2.4 (with UfW patches), with GnuTLS 3.7.9 and PKCS #11 support, with\nGcrypt 1.10.2-unknown, with Kerberos (MIT), with MaxMind, with nghttp2 1.49.0,\nwith brotli, with LZ4, with Zstandard, with Snappy, with libxml2 2.9.14, with\nlibsmi 0.5.0, with QtMultimedia, with automatic updates using WinSparkle 0.8.0,\nwith AirPcap, with Minizip, with binary plugins, debug build (+utf8).\n\nRunning on 64-bit Windows 11 (22H2), build 22621, with 12th Gen Intel(R)\nCore(TM) i7-1270P (with SSE4.2), with 32435 MB of physical memory, with GLib\n2.72.3, with **Qt 6.5.2**, with Npcap version 1.75, based on libpcap version 1.10.4,\nwith PCRE2 10.40 2022-04-14, with c-ares 1.18.1, with GnuTLS 3.7.9, with Gcrypt\n1.10.2-unknown, with nghttp2 1.49.0, with brotli 1.0.9, with LZ4 1.9.3, with\nZstandard 1.5.2, without AirPcap, with light display mode, **with mixed DPI**, with\nLC_TYPE=Finnish_Finland.utf8, binary plugins supported.",
          "author": {
            "id": 7558431,
            "username": "markkuleinio",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Markku Leiniö",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/7558431/avatar.png?v=1789663372",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/markkuleinio"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-08-12T07:01:44.096Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-08-12T07:05:46.567Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 192106872,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": true,
          "resolved": false,
          "resolved_by": null,
          "resolved_at": null,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 8971,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
